        },
        {
            "id": "nsdap",
            "legend": "NSDAP",
            "name": "NSDAP",
            "seats": Math.round(Q.nsdap_wl*0.8),
        },
    ];
}
else {
    data = [
        {   "id": "uspd",
            "legend": "USPD",
            "name": "USPD",
            "seats": Math.round(Q.uspd_wl*0.8),
        },
        {
            "id": "spd",
            "legend": "SPD",
            "name": "SPD",
            "seats": Math.round(Q.spd_wl*0.8),
        },
        {
            "id": "ddp",
            "legend": Q.ddp_name,
            "name": Q.ddp_name,
            "seats": Math.round(Q.ddp_wl*0.8),
        },
        {
            "id": "z",
            "legend": "Center",
            "name": "Center",
            "seats": Math.round(Q.z_wl*0.8),
        },
        {
            "id": "dvp",
            "legend": "DVP",
            "name": "DVP",
            "seats": Math.round(Q.dvp_wl*0.8),
        },
        {
            "id": "other",
            "legend": "Other",
            "name": "Other",
            "seats": Math.round(Q.other_wl*0.8),
        },
        {
            "id": "dnvp",
            "legend": "DNVP",
            "name": "DNVP",
            "seats": Math.round(Q.dnvp_wl*0.8),
        },
        {
            "id": "nsdap",
            "legend": "NSDAP",
            "name": "NSDAP",
            "seats": Math.round(Q.nsdap_wl*0.8),
        },
    ];
}
if (window && d3) {
    var width = 500; 
    var height = 500;
    var screenWidth = document.getElementById('content').offsetWidth;
    if (screenWidth < width - 50) {
        width = screenWidth - 50; 
        height = width;
        document.getElementById("reichstag").style.height = screenWidth/2 + "px";
    } 

    var parliament = d3.parliament();
    parliament.width(width).height(height).innerRadiusCoef(0.4);
    parliament.enter.fromCenter(true).smallToBig(true);
    parliament.exit.toCenter(false).bigToSmall(true);
    d3.select("#reichstag").datum(data).call(parliament);
}
!}
go-to: coalition_menu

= Election results

{!<svg id="reichstag" style="width: 500px; height: 250px;"> </svg>!}

{!<table>!} 
{!<tr><td>Party</td><td>Vote share</td><td>% Change</td></tr>!}
{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#E3000F; outline: 2px; outline-style: solid;'> </div> !} **SPD:** {!</td><td>!} **[+ spd_wl +]%** {!</td><td>!} **[+ stwl_change_spd +]** {!</td></tr>!}

[? if sapd_formed == 1 : {!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#C40000'> </div> !}SAPD: {!</td><td>!} [+ sapd_wl +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ stwl_change_sapd +] {!</td></tr>!} ?]

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#8B0000'> </div> !}USPD: {!</td><td>!} [+ uspd_wl +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ stwl_change_uspd +] {!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#DCCA4A'> </div> !} [+ ddp_name +]: {!</td><td>!} [+ ddp_wl +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ stwl_change_ddp +] {!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#000'> </div> !} Z: {!</td><td>!} [+ z_wl +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ stwl_change_z +] {!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#D5AC27'> </div> !} DVP: {!</td><td>!} [+ dvp_wl +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ stwl_change_dvp +] {!</td></tr>!}
 
{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#a0a0a0'> </div> !} Others: {!</td><td>!} [+ other_wl +] % {!</td><td>!} [+ stwl_change_other +] {!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#3f7bc1'> </div> !} DNVP: {!</td><td>!} [+ dnvp_wl +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ stwl_change_dnvp +] {!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#954B00'> </div> !} NSDAP: {!</td><td>!} [+ nsdap_wl +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ stwl_change_nsdap +] {!</td></tr>!}
{!</table>!}

**Potential coalitions:**

Left Coalition (SPD + USPD): [+ wl_left_coalition +]%

USPD-tolerated SPD Minority (SPD alone): [+ wl_uspd_tolerated_spd_minority +]%;

SPD Majority (SPD Alone): [+ spd_wl +]%

USPD-tolerated Social-Liberal Coalition (SPD + [+ ddp_name +]): [+ wl_uspd_tolerated_social_liberal_coalition +]% 

Social-Liberal Coalition (SPD + [+ ddp_name +]): [+ wl_social_liberal_coalition +]%

Social-Christian Coalition (SPD + Z): [+ wl_social_christian_coalition +]%

Weimar Coalition (SPD + Z + [+ ddp_name +]): [+ wl_weimar_coalition +]%

USPD-tolerated Weimar Coalition (SPD + Z + [+ ddp_name +]): [+ wl_uspd_tolerated_weimar_coalition +]%

Grand Coalition (SPD + Z + BVP + [+ ddp_name +] + DVP): [+ wl_grand_coalition +]%

Bourgeois Coalition (Z + BVP + [+ ddp_name +] + DVP + Others): [+ wl_bourgeois_coalition +]%

Right-wing Coalition (Z + BVP + DVP + Others + DNVP): [+ wl_right_coalition +]%

[? if nazi_urgency <= 1 and nsdap_wl >= 15 : The rapid rise in NSDAP votes is extremely worrying. Many had believed that the party was moribound; now, some of us consider it to be the greatest threat to democracy in Germany. ?]

[? if w_anti_democratic_coalition >= 50 : Together, the anti-democratic USPD, DNVP, and NSDAP have a majority in the Landtag. A stable governing majority will be almost impossible. ?]

There are some potential coalition arrangements.

@coalition_menu

- @wl_left_coalition
- @wl_uspd_tolerated_spd_minority: A USPD-tolerated SPD Minority?
- @wl_spd_majority: We can rule alone!
- @wl_uspd_tolerated_social_liberal_coalition: A USPD-tolerated Social-Liberal Coalition?
- @wl_social_liberal_coalition: A Social-Liberal Coalition?
- @wl_social_christian_coalition: A Social-Christian Coalition?
- @wl_weimar_coalition: A Weimar Coalition?
- @wl_uspd_tolerated_weimar_coalition: A USPD-tolerated Weimar Coalition?
- @wl_grand_coalition: A Grand Coalition?
- @wl_bourgeois_coalition: A Bourgeois Coalition forms?
- @wl_right_coalition: A Right-wing Coalition forms?

@wl_left_coalition
title: A Left coalition.
subtitle: SPD + USPD ([+ wl_left_coalition +]%)
view-if: wl_left_coalition >= 50
choose-if: President != Hindenburg
unavailable_subtitle: The current President would immediately *Reichsexecute* such a government if it were to form.
on-arrival: in_wurttemburg_spd = 1; in_wurttemburg_uspd = 1; in_wurttemburg_dnvp = 0; in_wurttemburg_nsdap = 0; in_wurttemburg_left = 1; in_wurttemburg_tolerated_spd = 0; in_wurttemburg_spd = 0; in_wurttemburg_tolerated_soclib= 0; in_wurttemburg_soclib= 0; in_wurttemburg_socchr= 0; in_wurttemburg_tolerated_weimar= 0; in_wurttemburg_weimar= 0; in_wurttemburg_groko = 0; in_wurttemburg_bourgeois= 0; in_wurttemburg_right= 0; in_wurttemburg_nsdap = 0; workers_spd += 3*(1-dissent)

The SPD enters a coalition with the USPD.

@wl_uspd_tolerated_spd_minority
title: An SPD Minority government with USPD toleration.
subtitle: SPD + USPD ([+ wl_uspd_tolerated_spd_minority +]%)
view-if: wl_uspd_tolerated_spd_minority >= 50
choose-if: uspd_relation >= 45 and hindenburg_relation >= 40
unavailable_subtitle: We do not have sufficient relations with either President Hindenburg or the USPD.
on-arrival: in_wurttemburg_spd = 1; in_wurttemburg_uspd = 0; in_wurttemburg_dnvp = 0; in_wurttemburg_nsdap = 0; in_wurttemburg_left = 0; in_wurttemburg_tolerated_spd = 1; in_wurttemburg_spd = 0; in_wurttemburg_tolerated_soclib= 0; in_wurttemburg_soclib= 0; in_wurttemburg_socchr= 0; in_wurttemburg_tolerated_weimar= 0; in_wurttemburg_weimar= 0; in_wurttemburg_groko = 0; in_wurttemburg_bourgeois= 0; in_wurttemburg_right= 0; in_wurttemburg_nsdap = 0; workers_spd += 3*(1-dissent)

The SPD forms a minority government with the toleration of the USPD.

@wl_spd_majority
title: An SPD Majority government at last!
view-if: spd__wl >= 50
choose-if: spd__wl >= 50
on-arrival: in_wurttemburg_spd = 1; in_wurttemburg_uspd = 0; in_wurttemburg_dnvp = 0; in_wurttemburg_nsdap = 0; in_wurttemburg_left = 0; in_wurttemburg_tolerated_spd = 0; in_wurttemburg_spd = 1; in_wurttemburg_tolerated_soclib= 0; in_wurttemburg_soclib= 0; in_wurttemburg_socchr= 0; in_wurttemburg_tolerated_weimar= 0; in_wurttemburg_weimar= 0; in_wurttemburg_groko = 0; in_wurttemburg_bourgeois= 0; in_wurttemburg_right= 0; in_wurttemburg_nsdap = 0; workers_spd += 4*(1-dissent)

The SPD forms a majority government!

