@wl_grand_coalition
title: A Weimar coalition.
subtitle: SPD + Z + [+ ddp_name +] ([+ wl_weimar_coalition +]%)
view-if: wl_grand_coalition >= 50
choose-if: z_relation >= 30 and ddp_relation >= 30 and dvp_relation >= 30
unavailable_subtitle: We do not have sufficient relations with one of the three parties
on-arrival: in_wurttemburg_spd = 1; in_wurttemburg_uspd = 0; in_wurttemburg_dnvp = 0; in_wurttemburg_nsdap = 0; in_wurttemburg_left = 0; in_wurttemburg_tolerated_spd = 0; in_wurttemburg_spd = 0; in_wurttemburg_tolerated_soclib= 0; in_wurttemburg_soclib= 0; in_wurttemburg_socchr= 0; in_wurttemburg_tolerated_weimar= 0; in_wurttemburg_weimar= 0; in_wurttemburg_groko = 1; in_wurttemburg_bourgeois= 0; in_wurttemburg_right= 0; in_wurttemburg_nsdap = 0; workers_spd -= 1*(1-dissent)

The SPD enters a Grand Coalition with the DDP, DVP and Zentrum.

@wl_bourgeois_coalition
title: A Bourgeois Coalition forms?
subtitle: [+ ddp_name +] + Z + DVP + Others ([+ wl_bourgeois_coalition +]%)
view-if: wl_bourgeois_coalition >= 50
choose-if: wl_bourgeois_coalition >= 50
on-arrival: in_wurttemburg_spd = 0; in_wurttemburg_uspd = 0; in_wurttemburg_dnvp = 0; in_wurttemburg_nsdap = 0; in_wurttemburg_left = 0; in_wurttemburg_tolerated_spd = 0; in_wurttemburg_spd = 0; in_wurttemburg_tolerated_soclib= 0; in_wurttemburg_soclib= 0; in_wurttemburg_socchr= 0; in_wurttemburg_tolerated_weimar= 0; in_wurttemburg_weimar= 0; in_wurttemburg_groko = 1; in_wurttemburg_right= 0; in_wurttemburg_nsdap = 0

A Bourgeois Coalition is formed.

@wl_right_coalition
title: A Right Coalition forms?
