view-if: wl_right_coalition >= 50
choose-if: wl_right_coalition >= 50
on-arrival: in_wurttemburg_spd = 0; in_wurttemburg_uspd = 0; in_wurttemburg_dnvp = 1; in_wurttemburg_nsdap = 0; in_wurttemburg_left = 0; in_wurttemburg_tolerated_spd = 0; in_wurttemburg_spd = 0; in_wurttemburg_tolerated_soclib= 0; in_wurttemburg_soclib= 0; in_wurttemburg_socchr= 0; in_wurttemburg_tolerated_weimar= 0; in_wurttemburg_weimar= 0; in_wurttemburg_groko = 0; in_wurttemburg_right= 1; in_wurttemburg_nsdap = 0

A Right Coalition is formed.
